                                                "sense_id": "e3910342-7c09-39e4-8691-3e3d3c6b8755",
                                                "text": "In the hand of what person soever it be alleged by the witness to be, a case may happen in which it may be material (though at the expense of a distinct enquiry) to authenticate or deauthenticate it by ulterior evidence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
